{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24826","headline":"行不由径 · 俞简","name":"行不由径","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古人心有尚，乃是孔门生。\n爲计安贫乐，当从大道行。\n讵应流远迹，方欲料前程。\n捷径虽云易，长衢岂不平。\n後来无枉路，先达擅前名。\n一示遵途意，微衷益自精。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"俞简","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24826.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24826","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}